## 📝 Description

### **Precondition:**  
 Map screen is open; Satellite mode button visible.
 
### **Steps to Reproduce:**
Bring the cursor close to the Satellite mode button.
   
### **Expected Result:**  
The button changed color. The Map objects option is opened in the list.

### **Actual Result:**  
When hovered over, the Satellite mode button doesn’t change color. The “Labels” checkbox is displayed only after the Satellite mode button is clicked.

